{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-sostrene-grene-led-string-lights-2603-0149","content_id":"fc754751-947b-4e65-8842-9cdf9556de51","description":"Product Recall for Søstrene Grene LED String Lights presenting a risk of fire. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"251faa8e-c9b4-4ba0-b821-f0b6690cbf53","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-03-27T15:41:31+00:00","id":"251faa8e-c9b4-4ba0-b821-f0b6690cbf53","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-03-27T15:41:31+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69c6a52bcdfd19de13d0f7f6/2603-0149-product-recall-sostrene-grenes-LED-string-lights.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Søstrene Grene LED String Lights</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of fire because heat build-up has been detected in the battery box during use. This could cause the battery box to melt, posing a risk of fire.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by Søstrene Grene.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Lighting equipment - rope/string lights</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Søstrene Grene</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model/Batch number</td>\n      <td> 264575</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td> 5711812975435 (blue/green), 5711812975442 (red/yellow)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>LED light chain available in blue and green or red and yellow. Product sold by Søstrene Grene between 31 October 2025 – 27 February 2026.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_251faa8e-c9b4-4ba0-b821-f0b6690cbf53\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69c6a52bcdfd19de13d0f7f6/2603-0149-product-recall-sostrene-grenes-LED-string-lights.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of fire because heat build-up has been detected in the battery box during use. This could cause the battery box to melt, posing a risk of fire.  </p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Electrical Equipment (Safety) Regulations 2016.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users by Søstrene Grene.   </p>\n\n<p>We recommend you cease use of this product immediately and return to your nearest Søstrene Grene store for a full refund or exchange. For more information, please contact <a href=\"mailto:contact.uk@sostrenegrene.com\">contact.uk@sostrenegrene.com</a> or access: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://press.sostrenegrene.com/en/recalls/product-safety-recall-led-string-lights/\">https://press.sostrenegrene.com/en/recalls/product-safety-recall-led-string-lights/</a>.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2603-0149</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-27T15:42:37Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"lighting-products","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-03-27","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-03-27T15:42:37+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-sostrene-grene-led-string-lights-2603-0149","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-sostrene-grene-led-string-lights-2603-0149","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-sostrene-grene-led-string-lights-2603-0149","content_id":"fc754751-947b-4e65-8842-9cdf9556de51","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-03-27T15:42:37Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Søstrene Grene LED String Lights (2603-0149)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-sostrene-grene-led-string-lights-2603-0149","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type","type":"text"},{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Serious","value":"serious"},{"label":"High","value":"high"},{"label":"Medium","value":"medium"},{"label":"Low","value":"low"},{"label":"Not provided","value":"not-provided"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_risk_level","name":"Risk level","preposition":"that are","short_name":"Risk level"